{"resourceIdentifier":"2537","resourceName":"Gansu Gaotai Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"Gansu Gaotai Biogas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) locates in Nanhua Industrial Zone, Gaotai County, Zhangye City, Gansu Province, P.R China. The project is to build a centralized anaerobic animal manure treatment system which collects manure waste of dairy cow and market swine from surrounding livestock farms in Gaotai County. An organic fertilizer production plant which utilizes residual waste from the CSTR digesters as raw materials will also be built at the project site. The project uses animal manure waste as ferment material to produce biogas in the Completely Stirred Tank Reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters. The biogas produced will be recovered and used to power the auxiliary equipment of the project’s animal manure treatment system and the organic fertilizer plant. The residual waste from the CSTR digesters will be used to produce organic fertilizer at the project site.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the animal manure waste was left to decay in anaerobic manure management system (uncovered open lagoon) at the livestock farms and methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility. Therefore, the project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane through recovery and destruction of biogas.","location":{"latitude":39.271388,"longitude":99.759720},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-06-24","endExclusive":"2021-07-25","endInclusive":"2021-07-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2537"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gansu Founder Energy Conservation Sci&Tech Service Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Gansu Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2537"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31631"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16/12/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/11/2019 - 31/10/2026"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=53084&IDKEY=30e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9n73202836","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"01-Gaotai_VCS PD_V01.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-06-07T15:47:04.7Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=53086&IDKEY=s8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0m73205594","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"03-Gaotai_VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-06-07T15:48:25.24Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=58832&IDKEY=898klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d081129328","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-Gaotai Biogas_20211020.pdf","uploadDate":"2021-12-14T16:47:48.107Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=54634&IDKEY=88723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0q75340286"